### Dashboard (requête protégée) avec token valide
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ0ZXN0VXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc3MTM0MTI4MiwiZXhwIjoxNzcxMzQ0ODgyfQ.BObwVhDIIT-HH_rzrZqqgUlIFC4AvW9vgNc5M7A6nKQ

###

###

### Dashboard sans token
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/dashboard

###

### Dashboard avec token invalide
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer INVALIDTOKEN

###

### Logout (requête protégée) avec token valide
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users/logout
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ0ZXN0VXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc3MTM0MTI4MiwiZXhwIjoxNzcxMzQ0ODgyfQ.BObwVhDIIT-HH_rzrZqqgUlIFC4AvW9vgNc5M7A6nKQ

###

### Logout sans token
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users/logout

###

### Logout avec token invalide
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users/logout
Authorization: Bearer INVALIDTOKEN

